    <briefdescription>
<para>POSIX pathname configuration constants (&lt;<ref refid="pathconf_8h" kindref="compound">sys/pathconf.h</ref>&gt;) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defines the <computeroutput>_PC_*</computeroutput> name constants used as the second argument to <ref refid="group__posix__option__group__file__system_1gaa4ea4bbebf4841965159e66b5d1a49e8" kindref="member">pathconf()</ref> and <ref refid="group__posix__option__group__file__system_1gadb0249f5cc10cdad4e5c133084186089" kindref="member">fpathconf()</ref> to query per-file configuration limits.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ulink url="https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/functions/pathconf.html">POSIX.1-2017 pathconf()</ulink> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
